?- trace, len([a], N).
 Call: (1) len([a],_G1) ? h
c, Enter  creep: stop at the next port
s         skip: at Call and Redo, do not stop until the next port of this call
l         leap: do not stop until a port of a spy point
f         fail: make this call fail
r         retry: go back to the Call port of this call
a         abort: stop the query
n         nodebug: switch debugging off and go on
g         goals: write the open calls, innermost first
w         write: write the goal without the depth limit
+, -      spy: place or remove a spy point on this predicate
h, ?      help: write this list
 Call: (1) len([a],_G1) ? ?
